# No environment variables are currently required to build or run this app.
#
# This file previously documented a VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY for AI receipt/
# statement scanning. That feature was removed entirely (see
# docs/features/README.md -> "AI/cloud document parsing" and
# docs/roadmap/decisions.md) — the app is fully local: SMS auto-capture,
# manual entry, and CSV import, no client-side or server-side API key
# involved. The only variable the app reads, VITE_APP_VERSION, is injected
# at build time from web-version.txt (see vite.config.js) — it isn't
# something you set here.
